  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　おなかを　すかせている。\nポケットの　ような　ふくろに　いれた\nタネを　たべて　でんきを　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "항상 배가 고프다.\n호주머니같이 생긴 주머니에 넣어둔\n씨앗을 먹어서 전기를 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "總是餓著肚子。\n會吃掉裝在像口袋一樣的\n袋子裡的種子來發電。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a toujours un petit creux. Il grignote les graines\nqu’il a mises dans ses sortes de poches\npour produire de l’électricité.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses immerzu hungrige Pokémon frisst Samen,\ndie es in seinen beutelartigen Taschen verwahrt,\nund produziert so Elektrizität.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre tiene hambre. Se nutre de las semillas\nque guarda en una suerte de bolsillos para\ngenerar electricidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha costantemente fame. Si nutre dei semi che\ntiene nelle sue tasche per produrre elettricità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "As it eats the seeds stored up in its pocket-like\npouches, this Pokémon is not just satisfying its\nconstant hunger. It’s also generating electricity.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　お腹を　すかせている。\nポケットの　ような　袋に　入れた\nタネを　食べて　電気を　つくる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "总是饿着肚子。\n会吃掉装在像口袋一样的\n袋子里的种子来发电。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre tiene hambre. Se nutre de las semillas\nque guarda en una suerte de bolsillos para\ngenerar electricidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どんなに　たべても　すぐに　おなかが\nすく。　でんきで　ローストした\nタネを　たいせつに　もちあるく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "아무리 먹어도 금방 배가 고프다.\n전기로 구운 씨앗을\n소중히 갖고 다닌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "無論怎麼吃都會馬上肚子餓。\n十分珍愛自己用電烘烤過的\n種子，隨時都帶在身上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a beau manger, il a tout le temps faim.\nIl a toujours des graines grillées à l’électricité\nsur lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Egal, wie viel es auch frisst, es wird sofort wieder\nhungrig. Es röstet Samen mit seiner Elektrizität\nund trägt diese dann vorsichtig mit sich herum.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre tiene apetito, sin importar lo mucho que\ncoma. Lleva con sumo cuidado las semillas que\nha tostado con su propia electricidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Indipendentemente da quanto mangia, è sempre\naffamato. Tiene molto ai semi che ha arrostito\ncon l’elettricità e li porta sempre con sé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It carries electrically roasted seeds with it as if\nthey’re precious treasures. No matter how much\nit eats, it always gets hungry again in short order.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "どんなに　食べても　すぐに　お腹が\nすく。　電気で　ローストした\nタネを　大切に　持ち歩く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "无论怎么吃都会马上肚子饿。\n十分珍爱自己用电烘烤过的\n种子，随时都带在身上。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Siempre tiene apetito, sin importar lo mucho que\ncoma. Lleva con sumo cuidado las semillas que\nha tostado con su propia electricidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　タネを　たべて　くうふくをおさえているが　くうふくが　すぎるとこころが　すさんで　そぼうになる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "항상 씨앗을 먹으며 배고픔을 억누르고 있으나, 너무 배가 고프면 성격이 거칠고 난폭해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "總是靠吃種子來抑制飢餓感。但若是餓肚子餓過了頭，就會心煩意亂，變得粗暴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il mange constamment des graines pour satisfaire son appétit. Quand il est trop affamé, il s’énerve et devient violent.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es frisst immerzu Samen, um seinen Hunger zu stillen. Wird dieser jedoch zu groß, verliert es die Nerven und verfällt in rasende Wut.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Come semillas continuamente para aplacar el apetito, pero, cuando tiene demasiada hambre, pierde los estribos y se pone hecho una furia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Mangia semi in continuazione per cercare di placare la fame, ma quando ne ha troppa s’innervosisce e diventa una furia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Morpeko eats seeds constantly to keep its hunger at bay. If it’s hungry for too long, it grows wild and brutish.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いつも　タネを　食べて　空腹を抑えているが　空腹が　過ぎると心が　荒んで　粗暴になる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然总是在靠吃种子来抑制饥饿感，但若是饿过头，就会心烦意乱变得粗暴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Come semillas continuamente para aplacar el apetito, pero, cuando tiene demasiada hambre, pierde los estribos y se pone hecho una furia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "いぶくろが　ちいさいので　ポケットにいれた　タネを　いつも　たべてないとすぐに　おなかが　すいてしまうのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "위가 작아서 주머니에 넣어 둔 씨앗을 계속 먹지 않으면 금방 배가 고파진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "胃很小，所以如果不一直拿口袋裡的種子來吃的話，馬上就會因空腹而感到餓。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "S’il ne mange pas constamment les graines qu’il emmagasine dans ses poches, son petit estomac se vide et il a immédiatement faim.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da sein Magen klein ist, wird es sofort hungrig, wenn es nicht ständig die Samen aus seinen Taschen frisst.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Debido al pequeño tamaño de su estómago, si no come constantemente las semillas que guarda en los bolsillos, le entra hambre de inmediato.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dato che ha uno stomaco piccolo, deve mangiare costantemente i semi che tiene nelle tasche, altrimenti gli viene subito fame.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has a small stomach. If it isn’t constantly eating the seeds it keeps in its pockets, it will get hungry immediately.",
      "language": {
